        "name": "Zumba: Burn it Up!",
        "summary": "Zumba is a global movement that brings the fun to fitness with over 15 million people taking weekly classes across 186 countries.\n\nGet your fix of the Zumba program anytime, anywhere with high-energy routines and hip-shaking jams including chart-topping hits and Zumba originals. Use the Joy-Con controllers to track your movements and get rewarded for dancing with energy and flair.",
